    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4666" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλόχευτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>born not in the natural
			way,</i> of Athena, <i><span class="en">
				Coluth.
				183
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unborn,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				8.27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>without birth-pangs,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὖλαξ κόσμου</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				24.269
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				41.53
			</span></i>.</div>
